{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight hordes of monsters and epic Bosses in a high-stakes 6x6 Arena where every tile is a battlefield, every card is a weapon, and every combo is a fortune.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/73c6e98d8f27ba9bc5e470a744871e93.webp?t=1769905272\" width=352 height=58 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Positional Dominance</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grid is a weapon. Slam enemies into walls, bait them into crossfires, and dominate a cramped 36-tile arena where one wrong step is your last. Positioning is power.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combo-Driven Economy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't just kill enemies; destroy them with style to maximize your gold and buy game-breaking relics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend or Die</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush the hordes: Hunt the Bosses, and climb the brutal Ascension ladder. Complete high-stakes Quests to sharpen your deck for the ultimate showdown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/e1d730328c8f81e1b1d5678c6e442e0d.poster.avif?t=1769905272\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/e1d730328c8f81e1b1d5678c6e442e0d.webm?t=1769905272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184620/extras/e1d730328c8f81e1b1d5678c6e442e0d.mp4?t=1769905272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag